    "Auto keeps the large avatar on the biggest iPhones and uses Medium on the rest. With the name hidden, tap the avatar for the bot's profile, or touch and hold it to switch bots.": {
      "comment": "Simplified Chinese draft for the word sweep (#990); fluent-speaker review pending.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Auto keeps the large avatar on the biggest iPhones and uses Medium on the rest. With the name hidden, tap the avatar for the bot's profile, or touch and hold it to switch bots."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "选择“自动”时，最大尺寸的 iPhone 使用大头像，其他机型使用中等头像。隐藏名字时，轻点头像可查看机器人资料，按住头像可切换机器人。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
