    "It sizes message text, on top of the text size in Appearance and your iPhone's own text size. Link previews show a web link's picture, title and summary in chats and the Feed. To make one, your iPhone opens that page, without cookies.": {
      "comment": "Simplified Chinese draft for Simple Bot mode, Teamwork and their Settings pages (#527); fluent-speaker review pending.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It sizes message text, on top of the text size in Appearance and your iPhone's own text size. Link previews show a web link's picture, title and summary in chats and the Feed. To make one, your iPhone opens that page, without cookies."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "它会在“外观”中的文字大小和 iPhone 本身的文字大小设置基础上调整消息文字。链接预览会在聊天和动态中显示网页链接的图片、标题和摘要。为生成预览，iPhone 会在不使用 Cookie 的情况下打开该网页。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It sizes message text, on top of the text size in Appearance. Link previews show a web link's picture, title and summary in chats and the Feed. To make one, your Mac opens that page, without cookies.": {
